<section class="review-section" id="overview">
<h2><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path><rect height="4" rx="1" ry="1" width="8" x="8" y="2"></rect></svg> Overview</h2>
<p>ZeroFox is a leading digital risk protection platform that leverages AI and machine learning to safeguard organizations against external cyber threats across social media, mobile apps, cloud platforms, email, and the surface, deep, and dark web. Founded to address the growing attack surface beyond traditional perimeters, ZeroFox provides comprehensive brand protection, executive protection, and threat intelligence capabilities.</p>
<p>The platform continuously monitors billions of data points across 4,000+ platforms and thousands of underground forums to detect phishing, impersonation, data leakage, brand abuse, and other digital risks. With its AI-driven automation and expert human analysis, ZeroFox enables security teams to identify, analyze, and respond to threats that could damage reputation, compromise credentials, or enable fraud.</p>
<p>Trusted by enterprises, government agencies, and financial institutions worldwide, ZeroFox has become essential for organizations that need to protect their digital presence, brand integrity, and stakeholders from sophisticated social engineering and external threats that bypass conventional security controls.</p>
</section>
